        {
          "text": "Emi ndre, emi mba yi ma ta, kpere emini yi ma nziza o’biria lambo atalau edeta edepi ’diyi pi ma drilia ’ba Levini be ’diyi yi mamilla, opianzi atapi ma suru Israelini ma dri cepi ’diyi be, Yerusalemua jo ale aliza Yehovaniri ma alia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
