          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O’du surisi ama o’bi dahabu mele pie jo Mungu amanini ma alia, afazu ’diyi be, Meremoti Uria mvi atalau edeta edepiri dri, de isu Eleazari Finehasi mvi ovu eri be indi, azini Yozabadi Yesua mvi pi ovu yi be, Noadia Binui mvi pie, yi ’ba Levini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
